<title>USA: Tobacco cos plan courthouse-steps FDA response.</title>
<headline>Tobacco cos plan courthouse-steps FDA response.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tobacco industry will deliver a joint statement on Friday following the verdict in the industry's legal challenge to the start of tobacco regulation by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.</p>
<p>The verdict by Judge William Osteen, twice delayed, is scheduled for 1100 EDT/1500 GMT at the federal courthouse in Greensboro, N.C.</p>
<p>Speaking through the Washington, D.C.-based public relations firm, Bozell Sawyer Miller Group, the industry announced it will issue its response on the steps of the courthouse shortly after the verdict.</p>
</text>
